   "lines": [
    "Drove Harry Chapin",
    "over to a lawn",
    "tennis party at",
    "Minot Welds; Rose,",
    "Rosy, Alice & the two",
    "Miss Lanes, Misses",
    "Bacon &c[?] were there.",
    "In the evening went",
    "out to Chestnut",
    "Hill; to pass Sunday",
    "with the Saltonstalls.",
    "My cart is the",
    "greatest success of the",
    "season.",
    "I brought Phil a gun,",
    "Cotty some soldiers, a gold",
    "pin for Rose and a",
    "silver one for Mamie."
   ],
